WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.600
I'm a weather station for moonquakes.

2
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:18.490
When my astronauts' empty lunar module was crashed into the Moon on purpose, I felt the Moon ring like a bell for nearly an hour. Nobody expected that.

3
00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:24.280
I listened for eight years, until someone on Earth switched me off.

4
00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:30.890
We landed a short walk from a robot that had waited for us since 1967.
